## Curated builds

Reviewed against patch 2.1.67 on 2026-05-13. The live patch is 2.2.16a, so these have not been re-read against it yet.

### EXP Default Sustain (EXP)

- Items: Tough Boots, War Axe, Hunter Strike, Queen's Wings, Oracle, Immortality
- Core: War Axe, Hunter Strike, Queen's Wings
- Emblem: Fighter Emblem with Firmness, Festival of Blood, Brave Smite
- Battle spell: Vengeance
- Flex: Warrior Boots over Tough Boots when Use against physical EXP lanes when crowd control is not the main reason you die.; Antique Cuirass over Oracle when Use when a physical skill fighter or assassin is deleting you before sustain can matter.; Athena's Shield over Oracle when Use against one-shot magic engage that decides the fight before you can finish Flash Combo.
- Total cost: 11040 gold

Standard EXP build for extended trades: War Axe and Hunter Strike create the contact window, then Queen's Wings and Oracle keep Lukas alive after he commits.

### EXP Anti-Sustain Frontline (EXP)

- Items: Warrior Boots, War Axe, Hunter Strike, Dominance Ice, Queen's Wings, Immortality
- Core: War Axe, Hunter Strike, Dominance Ice
- Emblem: Fighter Emblem with Firmness, Festival of Blood, Brave Smite
- Battle spell: Vengeance
- Flex: Tough Boots over Warrior Boots when Use when the enemy CC chain matters more than physical lane trading.; Sea Halberd over Dominance Ice when Use when you are reliably hitting the healing target yourself and need damage more than defensive anti-heal.; Brute Force Breastplate over Immortality when Use when the game is still mid-tempo and movement plus control-duration reduction beats a late revive.
- Total cost: 11210 gold

Anti-sustain EXP setup for regen fighters, shield supports, and attack-speed cores where Lukas must survive close enough to keep Lifebane active.

### Jungle Tempo Dive (Jungle)

